{
  "$comment": "The one catalogue of a brand's film types. A type is the second segment of a film id and of its CDN path: id <brand>-<type>-<subject>-v<NNN>, stable URL video/<brand>/<type>/<subject>/<market>-<lang>/fb-9x16.mp4. `repos` maps a repo to its brand; `aliases` map old or short words to a type; `brands` lists the types each brand has; each type carries its labels, the sentence a person says (say.en must contain a video.film.plan trigger), what its subject names and its defaults (values of settings.json length, ratio, platform). Read by `produce init|types` and `station.mjs settings|compose|lint` (zero tokens). Docs: content/docs/produce.mdx.",
